  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large skillet over medium heat.",
    "Add the diced onion, carrot, and celery and cook until the vegetables are tender.",
    "Add the thawed frozen peas to the skillet and cook for an additional 2-3 minutes.",
    "Season the vegetable mixture with salt and pepper to taste.",
    "Warm the taco shells according to the package instructions.",
    "Assemble the tacos by spooning the vegetable mixture into the taco shells.",
    "Top the tacos with shredded cheese and salsa.",
    "Serve the tacos immediately and enjoy."
